perf(qlora): Cache bf16 dequantized weights and relax memory pool trim
scale: ~43 lines across 3 files [S]

- `patches/qlora-rs-1.0.5/src/qlora.rs`: Modified `QuantizedLinear` to cache dequantized NF4 weights at the configured compute dtype (bf16) using `dequantize_nf4_with_dtype`. This avoids re-dequantizing on every forward pass.
- `crates/vox-plugin-mens-candle-cuda/src/candle_qlora_train/training_loop/mod.rs`: Changed the default CUDA memory-pool trim frequency from every optimizer step to every 16 steps. The previous default was found to be pure overhead with bf16 weight caching.
- `crates/vox-plugin-mens-candle-cuda/src/candle_qlora_train/mod.rs`: Enabled weight caching by default for `QLoraConfig` unless `VOX_MENS_NO_WEIGHT_CACHE` environment variable is set.

